<title>USA: Riverside Cty, Calif., deal repriced, ylds lowered.</title>
<headline>Riverside Cty, Calif., deal repriced, ylds lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Tuesday it repriced Riverside County Transportation Authority, Calif.'s $74.4 million bond deal, raising the par amount and lowering yields in several maturities.</p>
<p>AMT: 74,385,000 (approx. subject to change)    DATE: 08/05/97</p>
<p>ISSUER: Riverside County Transportation Commission	    ST: CA</p>
<p>ISSUE: Sales Tax Refunding &amp; Ltd Tax, 1997 Ser A &amp; B	  TAX STAT: Exempt-REV</p>
<p>M/SP/F: NA/NA/NA							  BOOK ENTRY: Y</p>
<p>ENHANCEMENTS: AMBAC Aaa/AAA/AAA DTD: 08/01/97 DUE: 6/1/98-09						SR MGR: Smith Barney</p>
<p>1ST CPN: 12/01/97 CALL: 6/1/07 @ 101, dtp 6/1/09 DELIVERY: 8/21/97 approx PAYING AGENT: First Trust of California NA, Los Angeles L.O.: O'Melveny &amp; Myers, Los Angeles MGRS: Bear Stearns; Artemis Capital; Piper Jaffray; PaineWebber</p>
